#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506128"
msgid "I think."
msgstr "Eu acho."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506488"
msgid "Hey there! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nDon't just walk up to me so casually!"
msgstr "Ei, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nNão chegue assim tão na intimidade!"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "506904"
msgid "Still…… Tsukumihara may be lax with its dress code,\nbut does her outfit even pass as a uniform…?"
msgstr "Mesmo que Tsukumihara seja liberal nas roupas,\naquele visual sequer conta como uniforme…?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507436"
msgid "Because I know her better than that."
msgstr "Pois a conheço melhor do que isso."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507484"
msgid "Her name is #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr "Seu nome é #C236196003Tohsaka Rin#CDEF."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507620"
msgid "When she's quiet, she seems like quite the refined lady,\nbut that's ruined by her headstrong and unrestrained personality,\ncoming off as a tomboy when she opens her mouth."
msgstr "Calada, passa a impressão de dama refinada,\nmas o gênio teimoso e solto estraga tudo,\nfazendo-a soar moleca assim que abre a boca."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507808"
msgid "……no. In my case, should I say it's a blessing?"
msgstr "……não. No meu caso, seria uma bênção?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507860"
msgid "I don't know how many times\nher activeness and positivity have helped me."
msgstr "Nem sei quantas vezes a iniciativa\ne a energia dela já me ajudaram."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508640"
msgid "\"……hm?\nWhy am I even picking a fight with #[him][her]#?\""
msgstr "\"……hum?\nPor que mesmo estou arrumando briga com #[ele][ela]#?\""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508704"
msgid "she said, as she tilted her head."
msgstr "ela disse, inclinando a cabeça."

